          %p#SyntheticDifferentialGeometry
            %strong
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
          %p
            Below we encounter generalizations of ordinary
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+geometry"} differential geometry
            that include explicit “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimals"}> infinitesimals
            ” in the guise of
            = succeed "," do
              %em
